Subject: [PATCH] bpf: add Mihomo cgroup socket-address support to Lineage 4.9

Requires: mihomo-ebpf-4.9.patch on the prepared LineageOS 4.9.337 tree
Donor: Linux v4.19.325 a67e7cdde7cc7984ae24c3c81a70dc1aa34424b1
Source: https://github.com/gregkh/linux/tree/v4.19.325
Lookup-and-delete syscall layout: Linux v5.10 2c85ebc57b3e1817b6ce1a6b703928e113a90442

Backport IPv4/IPv6 connect, UDP sendmsg/recvmsg hooks, their context verifier
and conversion, socket cookies and cgroup query. Keep unsupported bind, sock,
sockops and TC socket assignment hooks unregistered. Preserve 4.9 cgroup
locking and the existing ingress/egress filters.

Implement atomic scalar hash/LRU lookup-and-delete with the existing bucket
and LRU lock ordering; reject unsupported map types and nonzero flags. Limit
per-CPU LRU refill batches to 1..128 and at most capacity/(2*possible_cpus)
to prevent small maps being drained on CPU handoff. Keep the scan budget.

