 {
+	/* A fixed 128-node refill can drain a small shared map when a
+	 * different CPU needs its first node. Leave at least half of the
+	 * capacity outside per-CPU free batches, while retaining the existing
+	 * upper bound for large maps. The scan budget remains unchanged.
